<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:50:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>日本人寿保险公司对冲创历史新低，使日元走势复杂化</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/japan-life-insurers-complicate-yen-fight-with-record-low-hedging</link><description>日本最大的人寿保险公司在上半财年将货币对冲削减至历史新低后，日本齐心协力提振日元的努力遇到了重大阻力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/japan-life-insurers-complicate-yen-fight-with-record-low-hedging'&gt;日本人寿保险公司对冲创历史新低，使日元走势复杂化&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan’s Insurers Have ‘Given Up’ on Yen With Record-Low Hedging&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/japan-life-insurers-complicate-yen-fight-with-record-low-hedging</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:36:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市现在足够便宜：市场分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/asian-stock-markets-are-cheap-enough-now-3-minutes-mliv-video</link><description>汤姆·麦肯齐 (Tom Mackenzie)、斯凯拉·蒙哥马利·科宁 (Skylar Montgomery Koning) 和马克·库德莫尔 (Mark Cudmore) 在“彭博社：开盘交易”中为分析师和投资者解析了今天的关键主题。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/asian-stock-markets-are-cheap-enough-now-3-minutes-mliv-video'&gt;亚洲股市现在足够便宜：市场分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stock Markets Are Cheap Enough Now: Market Analysis&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/asian-stock-markets-are-cheap-enough-now-3-minutes-mliv-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:29:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>特朗普通过削弱“中国+1”的关税激怒贸易伙伴</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/trump-riles-trade-partners-with-tariffs-that-undercut-china-1</link><description>唐纳德·特朗普总统最新的关税举措可能会削弱自美中贸易战开始以来全球制造业的标志性转变之一：供应链移出中国。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/trump-riles-trade-partners-with-tariffs-that-undercut-china-1'&gt;特朗普通过削弱“中国+1”的关税激怒贸易伙伴&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump’s Tariffs Blunt Appeal of Moving Production Out of China&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/trump-riles-trade-partners-with-tariffs-that-undercut-china-1</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:05:24 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>